# The Incus layer of the shared OCI system images that the Trove guest image
# derives from, by digest: ghcr.io/fivetime/oci-system/incus, flavor
# ubuntu_noble, base apt snapshot 20261024T150000Z (tag
# ubuntu_noble-20261024T150000Z-fe64b1e3), fuse4fs in place of fuse2fs
# (the Incus driver's hw_incus_data_volume_fuse=fuse4fs) from
# fivetime/e2fsprogs af4dec39 with libfuse fe66006f: an owner reaches its
# own files, and the fuse4fs that Incus starts for a fuseblk mount (an
# intercepted mount on a Flavor with incus:intercept_data_volume_mounts)
# takes -o kernel,noexcl, so umount returns only after fuse4fs has
# written everything back. Move it when openstack-cloud-images publishes
# a newer Incus layer and the Incus driver's gate has passed on it.
BASE_IMAGE=ghcr.io/fivetime/oci-system/incus@sha256:1650c21748acc41f4ffb96c1b7e95895ea6c352085b20e5a414f57b25c57b552
